{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 23, :comments ["<b>Forever.</b> Like כריתות, and the tav is a root letter from the stem יצמיתם יהוה Eloheinu." "<b>For the earth is Mine.</b> This is a weighty reason. So too Moses said in his prayer: 'YHWH, a dwelling You have been for us' — 'You' is like a standing dwelling, and one generation goes and another comes."], :book :leviticus, :voice :ibn-ezra, :lang :en, :chapter 25, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [["On Your Way" "http://mobile.tora.ws/"]], :timestamp "2026-07-09T19:12:22.662549269Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}